WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-reelshort-6a3f6465934d3e8b110840c2 — Episode 38 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-28 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:04.060
Can I come in?

2
00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:06.060
But Arthur...

3
00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:23.340
Don't worry, he's too busy to pay attention to you right now.

4
00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:27.260
Did mom leave this for you?

5
00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:35.220
She always treated me like her little sister.

6
00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:39.220
When I was little, mom used to tell me things about you.

7
00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:41.220
She said she had a little girl in the orphanage.

8
00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:44.220
A girl with very stubborn eyes.

9
00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:50.460
She promised she'd come to pick me up and make me part of her family, but...

10
00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:58.090
I'll do it for her.

11
00:00:58.090 --> 00:01:01.090
After tomorrow, stay with me.

12
00:01:01.090 --> 00:01:05.090
Not for that old man, not for revenge, but for yourself.

13
00:01:05.090 --> 00:01:08.940
Vincent.
